  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A2N: Projet de Renforcement du syst&#xe8;me d&apos;alerte et des m&#xe9;canismes communautaires de r&#xe9;solution des conflits dans le sahel-Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program aims to promote a peaceful social climate and a beneficial dialogue between the host population and/or the refugees in the border area of Sahel, Burkina Faso. The program is to be completed by strengthening the financial and material capacity of the local protection communities along with promoting the social cohesion across the income-generating activities.</narrative>
  </description>
